{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2015/02/14/8173213/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スピリッツさん発売中です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコ作りしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブブカさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTB+さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーキーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々、いろいろと撮影させていただいてます。ありがたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野七瀬のオールナイトニッポンをさせていただくことになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ど、どうなるのか( ・∇・)！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら聴いてください～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこスキー合宿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイきんぐさん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2015/02/14/8173213/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ち時間のときに小峠さんが黙々と雪だるま作ってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあと、雪合戦してくれてん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しいなぁって思いました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新潟の雪と触れ合えたし、楽しいロケでした(≡^∇^≡)えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会2daysありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2015/02/14/8173213/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まみろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2015/02/14/8173213/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキーウェアって、めっちゃ温かい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スノボもやってみたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/22って極寒の7時間やからスキーウェアを着ていくのもありやと思います！ほんまに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分らも頑張らなあかんけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気力、体力、集中力..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂のときに電気付けずに入るんが好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応、部屋からの明かりあるから完全に真っ暗じゃないけど( ・∇・)薄暗くて楽しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは大豆のグラノーラをバリバリ食べてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たとえ朝早い日でも、第一声からかなりでかい声出してるからいつも笑ってまう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ春。"}],"source":"archive"}